(>> 6.4 Embedded Systems Architectures and IoT Framework) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Microcontroller Architecture: Harvard architecture \(separate physical instruction) Tj
T*
(and data memory buses, allowing parallel instruction fetch and operand execution\) vs.) Tj
T*
(Von Neumann architecture \(shared bus for code and data, subject to the Von Neumann) Tj
T*
(bottleneck\).) Tj
T*
(* Key Peripherals: Analog-to-Digital Converter \(ADC: Successive Approximation) Tj
T*
(Register SAR or Delta-Sigma architectures\), General Purpose I/O \(GPIO\), Timers, PWM,) Tj
T*
(and communication protocols \(UART, SPI, I2C, CAN\).) Tj
T*
(* Internet of Things \(IoT\) Three-Layer Hierarchy: \(1\) Perception Layer \(Sensors and) Tj
T*
(actuators gathering physical data\), \(2\) Network/Transport Layer \(WiFi, BLE, LoRaWAN,) Tj
T*
(Cellular transmitting data using MQTT or CoAP protocols\), \(3\) Application/Cloud Layer) Tj
T*
(\(AWS IoT, Azure, ThingSpeak analyzing data, executing predictive analytics and) Tj
T*
(supervisory control\).) Tj
